        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0051234"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The directed movement of substances (such as macromolecules, small molecules, ions) or cellular components (such as complexes and organelles) into, out of or within a cell, or between cells, or within a multicellular organism by means of some agent such as a transporter or a transporter complex, a pore or a motor protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
