        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007267"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The transfer of information from one cell to another, where the signal travels from the signal-producing cell to the receiving cell by passive diffusion or bulk flow in intercellular fluid. The signaling cell and the receiving cell are usually in the vicinity of each other.</obo:IAO_0000115>
