        <rdfs:comment>Note that this term should not be used for direct annotation. If you are trying to make an annotation to x phase, it is likely that the correct annotation is &apos;regulation of x/y phase transition&apos; or to a process which occurs during the reported phase. To capture the phase when a specific location or process is observed, the phase term can be used in an annotation extension (PMID:24885854) applied to a cellular component term (with the relation exists_during) or a biological process term (with the relation happens_during).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>menopause</rdfs:label>
