            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The increase in size or mass of an entire organism, a part of an organism or a cell, where the increase in size or mass has the specific outcome of the progression of the organism over time from one condition to another.</obo:IAO_0000115>
